.TH MYGREP 3 "2026" "libmyutils" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search a file for lines containing a pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "myfilefunctions.h"
.sp
.BI "int mygrep(FILE *" fp ", const char *" search_str ", char ***" matches ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
Searches each line of the file pointed to by
.I fp
for the substring
.I search_str,
and stores matching lines in the
.I matches
array. Returns the count of matches found, or -1 on failure.
